                    {
                        "form_id": "35834683-2a4b-4dab-8174-b2b11622ec1d",
                        "entry_id": "273aad10-0ae3-34fe-a34e-bb02434f362c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "сунни́тах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9006873d-82f5-3235-8c2f-23c2411f3ec7",
                        "entry_id": "273aad10-0ae3-34fe-a34e-bb02434f362c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ислам. последователь суннизма"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48eed97b-2768-40cd-a80b-d321cc089a74",
                                "sense_id": "9006873d-82f5-3235-8c2f-23c2411f3ec7",
                                "text": "И хотя их учение чуждо религиозному мировоззрению дагестанских мусульман-суннитов, община «чистых мусульман» росла как на дрожжах."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1bf2671-5e58-4226-9829-8a666b06adc1",
                                "sense_id": "9006873d-82f5-3235-8c2f-23c2411f3ec7",
                                "text": "Персияне следуют секте шаги, а все горцы сунниты, и ненавидят друг друга насмерть."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9f264278-b640-4ee5-95ee-1c766a44fd06",
                        "source_entry_id": "273aad10-0ae3-34fe-a34e-bb02434f362c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9006873d-82f5-3235-8c2f-23c2411f3ec7",
                        "target_lang_word": "Sunni",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sunni",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bdaf75ff-4b28-395c-a895-d225486b56e5",
                                        "entry_id": "befe8967-0493-332b-8534-3112b3975e93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Belonging or relating to the branch of Islam based on the Qur'an, the Kutub al-Sittah (the hadiths which record the Sunnah) and that places emphasis on the Sahabah."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c15f9196-1000-4cda-b679-f56ba06e46c7",
                                                "sense_id": "bdaf75ff-4b28-395c-a895-d225486b56e5",
                                                "text": "I therefore strongly advocate the formation of a local capital but not at Hillah, which is too Sunni and near Baghdad"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4df38d42-3bf1-46a6-8e3a-c9c85d82d58e",
                                                "sense_id": "bdaf75ff-4b28-395c-a895-d225486b56e5",
                                                "text": "members […] came to view themselves collectively as the righteous descendants of Husayn confronting an evil and fundamentally alien ruler: a shah more Zoroastrian than Muslim, more Sunni than Shi'i, more Arab than Iranian, more Yazid than Husayn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "486562ec-693e-4b3d-bc93-68648f56d54f",
                                                "sense_id": "bdaf75ff-4b28-395c-a895-d225486b56e5",
                                                "text": "Many Shias who had become more Sunni in their religious practices reverted back to their original sect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sunni",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87791edc-1fc2-315c-894e-14329d5928d2",
                                        "entry_id": "2b77f935-e819-3c87-b880-e190bacb1ca1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A follower of Sunni Islam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Sunni",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68c9cdb0-b705-3bd7-a90a-8b1c8cf883a2",
                                        "entry_id": "71c355e9-fa4f-3f05-a846-48236be9c9d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of Sunni Islam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "ellipsis"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77d65aed-0bfe-45ce-9d93-7a5d94a880f7",
                                                "sense_id": "68c9cdb0-b705-3bd7-a90a-8b1c8cf883a2",
                                                "text": "In Islam, Sunni is a more triumphant version of the faith than Shia, which stresses the importance of suffering, following the founder Ali, who was persecuted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a695b24-7e41-4b75-814d-4642ca419248",
                                                "sense_id": "68c9cdb0-b705-3bd7-a90a-8b1c8cf883a2",
                                                "text": "Sunni has four schools of Islamic doctrine and law — Hanafi, Maliki, Shafi'i, and Hanbali — which uniquely interpret the Hadith, or recorded oral traditions of Muhammad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b9a2eb2-7d71-4bd6-8a1c-bf66930a6b38",
                                                "sense_id": "68c9cdb0-b705-3bd7-a90a-8b1c8cf883a2",
                                                "text": "Sunni is the mainstream religion, based in Mecca, and is generally more moderate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "daff6eb2-fd39-4675-9e8c-8e39255dd0f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "273aad10-0ae3-34fe-a34e-bb02434f362c",
